Package: OmixSeurat
Type: Package
Title: Seurat Pseudobulk Data Bridge for OMIX
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Margaret", "Cam", email = "maggie.cam@nih.gov", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Author: Margaret Cam [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Margaret Cam <maggie.cam@nih.gov>
Description: Extracts raw counts and aligned cell metadata from Seurat objects,
    then creates donor-by-condition pseudobulk profiles as the portable
    counts-plus-metadata input contract used by OMIX modules.
